# A quote escaped with a backslash, inside a bracketed string array. Before
# GMANRIBTokenize::parseString decoded escapes, the unescaped "\"" closed
# the string early, the array never saw its "]", and the parse desynced
# from there on -- exactly the failure AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section,
# "The desync convention," is written to catch. A trailing Sphere follows
# that convention.
Display "string_escape.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 16 16 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [30]
WorldBegin
Attribute "user" "note" ["a \" b"]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
